hans have become the ones most deeply affected by the haze of war.","abilities":["Friendly Unit","Once their identity is confirmed, restores your max DP after retreating to the Objective Point"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":250,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"sarkaz_absurdist_splitcaster":{"slug":"sarkaz_absurdist_splitcaster","name":"Sarkaz Absurdist Splitcaster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Absurdist Splitcaster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A product of the cooperation between the Damazti Cluster and the Military Commission, able to effortlessly split themselves in two with Arts. They can easily adapt their imperfect replicas to draw the enemy's attention and give themselves an advantage.","abilities":["When HP is below half, creates a <Virtual Image> at their location"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":650,"def":250,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"sarkaz_absurdist_tyrant_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_absurdist_tyrant_captain","name":"Sarkaz Absurdist Tyrant Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Absurdist Tyrant Captain.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A product of the cooperation between the Damazti Cluster and the Military Commission, able to change their appearance with Arts. They can skillfully manipulate their flesh without damaging their brains, and are used to employing their intimidating forms to gain an advantage in battle.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by Operators with 3 or more Block","First attack deals Splash damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":